              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and bow. Rides a horse. Army General. Feigned Flight. Parthian Shot. Expert Horsemen.</characteristic>
