              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Tribesmen have hand weapon and bow. Light Cavalry. Feigned Flight. Parthian Shot. Expert Horsemen. Any tribesmen may fight dismounted as Skirmishers (-16 points). There must be at least twice as many tribesmen figures as there are noble figures in the army.</characteristic>
